('0a0390','Snapshot construction copies32 bytes of each sequence and128 bytes of its auxiliary record into164-byte records, overwrites byte15 with0xff and stores optional section0x2000 DWORD+4 at record+160, default0. It finally publishes aux=output and payload=0, including the zero-count branch.','There is no output capacity check or free of the previous payload in this body. A cached duration0 is not the fallback track scanner result. Input/output overlap and source mutation are not proven safe.'),
('0a04b0','Rebind calls08C250 to unlink the current hash entry, stores the new pointer in bank+8 and invokes the concrete object virtual+16 initializer.','No payload free, size validation or ownership transfer is established by this body. Reinitialization may mutate sequence cache bytes through09FBD0; this is not an offline validation API.'),
('0a4340','The optional0x2000 section starts after version-sized basic data and enabled0x100,0x400,0x800,0x8000 sections. Section lengths come respectively from DWORD+0, BYTE+0, BYTE+1 and WORD+2. Its absence returns0.','Offsets accumulate in32-bit registers and then zero-extend. No source extents or arithmetic overflow checks are provided here. A present section pointer does not establish that its duration field is readable.'),
('0a45b0','The sequence-entry getter rejects an unsigned byte index >=sequence byte0, sums enabled optional section lengths including version4 extended+4, and chooses8-byte stride for kind2,4,12; all other byte kinds use4-byte stride.','The stride set is derived from the AL mask/exception and exhaustively modeled for256 kinds. It is not a type enumeration or proof that all such formats occur in retail data.'),
('0b78f0','The duration scanner dispatches64 WORD opcodes through a13-target table. Opcode3 adds DWORD to a wrapping signed32 accumulator; opcodes0,14,16,53 return float(accumulator)*0.001. Unknown or designated-default opcodes return0. Fixed and variable handlers advance a wrapping signed32 cursor.','No input length or iteration limit is passed. Signed fields in cases61/63 permit nonprogressing or backwards arithmetic in synthetic data. This is not a full audio bytecode decoder, loop-duration resolver or observed retail crash.'),
('08abd0','Under the selected sound critical section, the getter walks the native bank list and returns the first bank+32 handle with flag+128 bit0 set, else0.09FDE0 uses this handle on its concrete SoundDriver delegation path.','This is first-match list order, not an exclusive singleton or lifetime lease. It does not retain the selected bank.'),
